 control now  they can't get to our guys because of  the nuisance that is the frontier Dome  Kaku calls it a Marvel and it goes to  show the power of science to actually  pose a problem for strong characters  Luchi is asked if he's determined to  ignore the Navy and Luchi response that  he refuses to accept Straw Hat as an  emperor which is hilarious to me it's  definitely because of his personal  history with him but I like seeing such  individuality within the Marine greens  it would be boring if they all just  followed orders and speaking of not  falling orders just wait for it it's  gonna get crazy we then jump to the  different punks arguing what they should  do and then another allies brought up  who is on the island another intriguing  mystery it said that they shouldn't call  them because then they'd be risking  their lives and they'd have nowhere left  to hide if they're in the government  sites too but main body vegapunk doesn't  hesitate to call and ask for help and  the voice says of course and that  they've been prepared for this order so  intriguing man and it's nice to see that  our side seems to be getting some help  since the last few chapters with the  seraphim's drawing cp0 and keys are  arriving were all about the Marines  getting in a better and better situation  this figure seems to be a big deal since  it said Escape should be a piece of cake  now with them on board all they gotta do  is just keep cp0 busy Lilith says she'll  take them to port with Megaforce one and  it's hilarious that it took me actually  reading out loud while recording this to  realize that it sounds like Air Force  One that's hilarious but anyways that's  where they can presumably get on the  straw hat ship and in another hilarious  moment Daft Punk says I approve only for  Lilith to say who put you in charge love  that even these satellites have so much  personality and fleshed out Dynamics and  it's definitely understandable between a  number one and number two vegapunk then  gets packed and asks them to take all  seven of them to the ship although I  personally doubt that they'll all make  it on board for sanji's sake though I  hope Lilith does make it and I just love  to see how hyped up Frankie is about  traveling with the seven faces of the  world's best scientist vegapunk is like  his mihawk then we jump to Bonnie trying  to hunt down vegapunk and Luffy chasing  after her telling her that he promised  to get the old-timer out of here in one  piece and yes they just said the title  of the show in the chapter coincidence  probably and if you want Bonnie to join  the crew like me let everyone know by  Smashing that like button let's see how  much of us there are but then another  shocking thing happens the frontier  defenses go offline why I have no idea  the punks are wondering who would  disable it and for what reason and they  are told that no one is picking up  anything in the control room so another  mystery presents itself interestingly  enough Luchi is the one who thinks it  might be a trap since it seems so  convenient and yeah it is insanely  convenient for them to be sure to the  point where Oda better have a good  explanation for it soon I mean yes it's  more interesting if a conflict happens  but at the same time it's unrealistic so  there has to be a good reason they try  and everything seems okay so they  conclude that the heavens must have  abandoned vegapunk they arrive at the  straw hat ship so this seems to be where  things will go down since the straw hats  are headed there too Kaku goes to  destroy the ship and he has the most  confident satisfied smirk as he's about  to do it and it's so satisfying for me  when we see Zorro wake up from his nap  and slash away his attack like it was  nothing immediately Kaku gets upset and  you love to see the change in expression  xor is irritated that someone  interrupted his nap man he's so cool  whereas Kaku looks shocked and like he  fears for his life Sweat Beads pouring  down his face and everything and I'm  hyped because I always get get excited  about Zorro fights and Zorro action  sometimes even more excited than Luffy  action I gotta say the satellites get  the frontier Dome back online but the  cp0 agents have already infiltrated and  our guys know that they'll Target the  ship it's so good that Zoro is there  though I have no fear of them destroying  it with Zorro there to protect it not at  all Luffy and Chopper are finally  reunited with the rest of the crew and  Luffy is kind of upset that they are  rushing to leave after they just arrived  to this really cool place and then  people notice that Bonnie is missing and  so is surprise surprise vegapunk 100  points to anyone who can guess why  they're missing but then it's revealed  when we jump to vegapunk running for his  life and saying they're in a rush  however Bonnie is not having any of it  she asks if he can turn her dad back to  normal yes or no and we get another clue  when vegapunk says no but that there is  a reason for that he even wanted to  explain but so far Bonnie isn't hearing  him out so hopefully soon we'll get the  truth behind Kuma revealed then what is  maybe the most high part of the chapter  we see kid and his crew and they end end  up at the home of giants elbaf this is  so hyped to me in part because the one  piece Community has been hyping up the  al-bath arc for so long and associating  Shanks with it so not only is this  exciting because kid has history with  Shanks but also because it could be the  beginning of a much hyped up al-bath Arc  or at least teasing it but as if that  wasn't a good place to end Oda gives us  another hype detail that is arguably  even more hype we get garpa being GARP  and that's always a good thing we figure  out that he wants to launch an offensive  against an emperor and when he's asked  if he ran it by people in charge he said  why would he such an epic response this  dude must be the top three coolest in  the series I must say it's also pointed  out that he survived in the Navy for  decades with that attitude such a boss  such a boss such a boss he just says  don't worry about it and it's revealed  he's at G14 but he's not going to nearby  Egghead instead he meets up with  helmeppo who's crying about Kobe still  GARP says stop whimpering it's hard to  watch and get on board to helmeppo he  says they are going to Pirate Island  Blackbeard's HQ he says let's beat the  snot out of those pirates and save  Captain Kobe and wow that is huge the  hero of the Marines GARP the one alluded  to in the title of the chapter which was  a hero's offensive how mepo starts  crying even harder in the face of such  awesomeness in the context of the story  I feel like this conflict may be a way  for Oda to Hype up Blackbeard even more  but either way this is as hype as it  gets GARP is past his prime yes but he's  still a living legend and a half and I  can't wait to see how Oda deals with  this situation and we got to keep in  mind GARP is not just ignoring the Navy  he's also going after another Emperor  Blackbeard who is an antagonist to Luffy  and Luffy obviously wants to save Kobe  too so this is pretty much like GARP  just teaming up with Luffy right now and  the implications are so hype I can't  even explain them all right here however  even a legend like GARP will have  trouble with the Blackbeard Pirates and  if you want to know why don't miss my  video about all 16 Blackbeard pirates  and their powers explained link on  screen right now and in the description

